{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.974,"lines":[{"text":"Intro]","t":6.46,"e":6.66,"w":[["Intro",6.46,6.66]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"Seigneur, quand les nuages sont trop lourds...","t":6.76,"e":10.54,"w":[["Seigneur",6.76,7.46],["quand",7.58,7.88],["les",7.9,8.06],["nuages",8.14,9.06],["sont",9.18,9.7],["trop",9.72,9.9],["lourds",9.98,10.54]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand le chemin semble s'effacer sous mes pieds...","t":12.36,"e":18.32,"w":[["Quand",12.36,12.6],["le",12.66,12.92],["chemin",12.96,13.5],["semble",13.72,15.14],["s'effacer",15.2,16.48],["sous",16.66,17.04],["mes",17.14,17.6],["pieds",17.74,18.32]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Je n'ai personne d'autre à qui parler.","t":20.72,"e":23.66,"w":[["Je",20.72,20.78],["n'ai",21,21.26],["personne",21.38,21.94],["d'autre",22,22.58],["à",22.64,22.74],["qui",22.82,22.92],["parler",23.06,23.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Personne.","t":24.96,"e":25.94,"w":[["Personne",24.96,25.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On a tenté de construire, on a souvent fait fausse route","t":33.32,"e":37.04,"w":[["On",33.32,33.44],["a",33.5,33.58],["tenté",33.66,33.98],["de",34.02,34.18],["construire",34.24,34.9],["on",35.34,35.44],["a",35.5,35.58],["souvent",35.64,35.96],["fait",36.04,36.22],["fausse",36.3,36.58],["route",36.64,37.04]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On a semé des rêves dans les plaines du doute","t":37.4,"e":40.96,"w":[["On",37.4,37.52],["a",37.56,37.66],["semé",37.74,38.1],["des",38.16,38.46],["rêves",38.56,39.42],["dans",39.44,39.66],["les",39.7,39.84],["plaines",39.9,40.24],["du",40.3,40.58],["doute",40.66,40.96]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"On a cherché la paix dans les mains des hommes, sans jamais la trouver","t":41.22,"e":44.96,"w":[["On",41.22,41.3],["a",41.34,41.42],["cherché",41.5,41.94],["la",42,42.16],["paix",42.24,42.56],["dans",42.62,42.74],["les",42.78,42.9],["mains",42.96,43.08],["des",43.14,43.34],["hommes",43.36,43.64],["sans",43.7,43.82],["jamais",43.88,44.14],["la",44.2,44.3],["trouver",44.36,44.96]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mais au creux de mes silences, c’est ton nom que j'ai fini par nommer.","t":45.28,"e":48.86,"w":[["Mais",45.28,45.38],["au",45.4,45.48],["creux",45.54,45.74],["de",45.8,45.88],["mes",45.92,46.06],["silences",46.14,46.6],["c’est",46.82,46.92],["ton",46.98,47.08],["nom",47.14,47.26],["que",47.3,47.42],["j'ai",47.46,47.66],["fini",47.74,48.14],["par",48.22,48.38],["nommer",48.44,48.86]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Jésus !","t":49.7,"e":50.74,"w":[["Jésus",49.7,50.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu as les paroles de la vie, la vie","t":56.54,"e":61.06,"w":[["Tu",56.54,56.72],["as",56.88,57.24],["les",57.34,57.66],["paroles",57.82,58.86],["de",58.88,59.26],["la",59.38,59.54],["vie",59.64,60.26],["la",60.36,60.56],["vie",60.66,61.06]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"À qui irons-nous ?","t":61.96,"e":63.6,"w":[["À",61.96,62.06],["qui",62.14,62.4],["irons-nous",62.58,63.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Oh, Jésus ! (Tu es mon seul refuge, Seigneur !)","t":64.22,"e":71.4,"w":[["Oh",64.22,64.96],["Jésus",65.1,65.82],["Tu",69,69.16],["es",69.18,69.38],["mon",69.46,69.58],["seul",69.68,69.9],["refuge",69.94,70.76],["Seigneur",71.2,71.4]],"ok":0.88},{"text":"Jésus (Oui, c'est toi !)","t":71.64,"e":72.48,"w":[["Jésus",71.64,71.64],["Oui",71.64,71.82],["c'est",71.92,72.12],["toi",72.2,72.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu as les paroles de la vie, la vie","t":72.9,"e":77.36,"w":[["Tu",72.9,73.16],["as",73.56,73.58],["les",73.72,74],["paroles",74.14,75.1],["de",75.2,75.6],["la",75.7,75.84],["vie",75.96,76.56],["la",76.7,76.86],["vie",76.96,77.36]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"À qui irons-nous ?","t":78.26,"e":79.74,"w":[["À",78.26,78.38],["qui",78.48,78.68],["irons-nous",78.82,79.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Oh, Jésus ! (Au-delà de tout, il n'y a que toi)","t":79.83,"e":82.22,"w":[["Oh",79.83,80.03],["Jésus",79.91,80.11],["Au-delà",80,80.44],["de",80.5,80.62],["tout",80.76,80.96],["il",81.06,81.2],["n'y",81.26,81.34],["a",81.38,81.44],["que",81.5,81.66],["toi",81.72,82.22]],"ok":0.8},{"text":"C'est toi qui dessines les lignes, même quand le ciel est noir","t":84.1,"e":87.72,"w":[["C'est",84.1,84.24],["toi",84.3,84.46],["qui",84.5,84.62],["dessines",84.66,85.04],["les",85.06,85.22],["lignes",85.3,85.72],["même",86.14,86.3],["quand",86.38,86.64],["le",86.7,86.82],["ciel",86.9,87.14],["est",87.16,87.26],["noir",87.32,87.72]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es cette main qui se tend quand je perds tout espoir","t":88.2,"e":91.8,"w":[["Tu",88.2,88.32],["es",88.4,88.5],["cette",88.54,88.7],["main",88.74,88.9],["qui",88.96,89.08],["se",89.14,89.28],["tend",89.38,89.84],["quand",90.2,90.36],["je",90.42,90.66],["perds",90.76,90.92],["tout",90.96,91.16],["espoir",91.2,91.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu connais le poids de mes nuits, le secret de mes combats","t":92.14,"e":95.76,"w":[["Tu",92.14,92.22],["connais",92.28,92.56],["le",92.62,92.74],["poids",92.8,92.98],["de",93.04,93.12],["mes",93.18,93.34],["nuits",93.42,93.82],["le",94.12,94.22],["secret",94.28,94.76],["de",94.82,94.92],["mes",94.98,95.14],["combats",95.22,95.76]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Il n’y a aucune autre voix, qui puisse me ramener dans tes bras.","t":96.2,"e":99.82,"w":[["Il",96.2,96.28],["n’y",96.32,96.4],["a",96.42,96.48],["aucune",96.54,97.02],["autre",97.06,97.42],["voix",97.48,97.78],["qui",97.84,97.96],["puisse",98.04,98.3],["me",98.36,98.48],["ramener",98.54,99.02],["dans",99.08,99.22],["tes",99.28,99.44],["bras",99.5,99.82]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Oui Seigneur, à qui irons-nous ? (À qui irions-nous ?)","t":100.08,"e":103.56,"w":[["Oui",100.08,100.22],["Seigneur",100.34,100.82],["à",100.94,101],["qui",101.12,101.22],["irons-nous",101.58,102.26],["À",102.42,102.52],["qui",102.62,102.8],["irions-nous",102.92,103.56]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Quand la terre tremble, c'est toi qui restes debout","t":103.86,"e":107.64,"w":[["Quand",103.86,104.04],["la",104.12,104.24],["terre",104.34,104.54],["tremble",104.6,105.02],["c'est",105.12,105.28],["toi",105.34,105.56],["qui",105.9,106.32],["restes",106.42,107.1],["debout",107.18,107.64]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu parles à l'orage, tu parles à ma douleur","t":107.92,"e":111.36,"w":[["Tu",107.92,108.08],["parles",108.2,108.46],["à",108.58,108.62],["l'orage",108.68,109.42],["tu",109.96,110.1],["parles",110.22,110.46],["à",110.5,110.54],["ma",110.58,110.68],["douleur",110.74,111.36]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Ton mot est une semence, qui refleurit dans mon cœur","t":112,"e":115.74,"w":[["Ton",112,112.18],["mot",112.26,112.46],["est",112.52,112.74],["une",112.8,112.94],["semence",113.02,113.54],["qui",113.58,113.7],["refleurit",114.28,114.7],["dans",114.78,114.96],["mon",115.02,115.22],["cœur",115.28,115.74]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"À qui irons-nous ? (Dis-moi, à qui ?)","t":116.6,"e":119.08,"w":[["À",116.6,116.7],["qui",116.84,116.92],["irons-nous",117.28,117.96],["Dis-moi",118.1,118.52],["à",118.62,118.72],["qui",118.86,119.08]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"À qui irons-nous ? (Tu as le dernier mot sur ma vie !)","t":120.68,"e":124.48,"w":[["À",120.68,120.78],["qui",120.9,121.12],["irons-nous",121.32,121.86],["Tu",122.16,122.2],["as",122.24,122.36],["le",122.42,122.56],["dernier",122.64,123.1],["mot",123.16,123.32],["sur",123.42,123.6],["ma",123.68,124.1],["vie",124.16,124.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Jésus !","t":136.94,"e":137.8,"w":[["Jésus",136.94,137.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu as les paroles de la vie, la vie","t":140.96,"e":144.18,"w":[["Tu",140.96,141.14],["as",141.26,141.64],["les",141.7,141.86],["paroles",141.96,142.42],["de",142.48,142.62],["la",142.7,142.9],["vie",142.96,143.22],["la",143.3,143.48],["vie",143.98,144.18]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"Oui, tu as les paroles de la vie !","t":144.48,"e":156.45,"w":[["Oui",144.48,144.76],["tu",146.02,146.2],["as",146.32,146.48],["les",146.54,146.66],["paroles",146.74,147.24],["de",151.36,151.56],["la",155.48,155.58],["vie",156.25,156.45]],"ok":0.75},{"text":"À qui irons-nous ?","t":156.92,"e":156.92,"w":[["À",156.92,156.92],["qui",156.92,156.92],["irons-nous",156.92,156.92]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"À qui irons-nous ?","t":157,"e":158.42,"w":[["À",157,157.1],["qui",157.2,157.4],["irons-nous",157.7,158.42]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"À qui irons-nous ?","t":159.52,"e":161.18,"w":[["À",159.52,159.64],["qui",159.74,159.94],["irons-nous",160.1,161.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu as les paroles...","t":163.48,"e":165.3,"w":[["Tu",163.48,163.74],["as",163.86,164],["les",164.1,164.22],["paroles",164.36,165.3]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Qui restaurent nos âmes brisées.","t":167.64,"e":170.58,"w":[["Qui",167.64,167.88],["restaurent",167.94,168.6],["nos",168.62,169],["âmes",169.12,169.76],["brisées",169.8,170.58]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Jésus.","t":172.74,"e":173.6,"w":[["Jésus",172.74,173.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tu es tout ce qu'il nous reste.","t":174.62,"e":177.02,"w":[["Tu",174.62,174.76],["es",174.8,175.06],["tout",175.18,175.38],["ce",175.48,175.66],["qu'il",175.72,175.96],["nous",176,176.2],["reste",176.26,177.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Et c'est assez.","t":178.44,"e":179.98,"w":[["Et",178.44,178.6],["c'est",178.7,179.24],["assez",179.28,179.98]],"ok":1.0}]}